  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Disaster Vulnerability Reduction Project - APL2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this APL2 project is to reduce the vulnerability of the Capital District of Bogota to adverse natural events, by strengthening its capacity to manage disaster risks, and by reducing vulnerability in key sectors.</narrative>
  </description>
